<title>FINLAND: R.KONEVUOKRAAMO SWINGS TO H1 PROFIT.</title>
<headline>R.KONEVUOKRAAMO SWINGS TO H1 PROFIT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30,</p>
<p>				    (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit after fin items		   1.24 vs 1.24 loss</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)	    0.46 vs 0.51 loss</p>
<p> Net sales				   36.77 vs 33.81</p>
<p> Operating margin			   10.4 vs 9.7</p>
<p> Depreciation				  7.5 vs 8.1</p>
<p> Net profit				    1.2 vs 1.2 loss</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish construction machinery leasing</p>
<p>company is Rakentajien Konevuokraamo Oy.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +35 80 6805 0240</p>
